      "verdict": "CONVERGENT FALSIFICATION: both the label-free w-DTI MODEL and the blind off-catalogue SGMC PROXY read negative on the gate-clean parent; the preregistered near-zero-positive scenario is revised negative. Concentration of mass onto geophysical crests loses to the spaced parent at matched count -- the uniformity lever is confirmed, and the sign/size of the loss is dose-monotone."
